{
  "name": "Inflation Chamber",
  "icon": "theoreticalsciences:inflation_chamber",
  "category": "theoreticalsciences:strings",
  "sortnum": 82,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:inflation_chamber",
      "title": "Inflation Chamber",
      "text": "A sphere of containment glass around a pocket of false vacuum, wound with coils and lensed by gravitons. The inflaton inside rolls down its potential slowly enough to inflate - and then it reheats, and a universe's worth of matter is made.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 5$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This controller is too complex for a crafting grid. Build it on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Makes $(item)Inflaton Condensate$() from the $(fluid)Inflaton Field$() and $(fluid)False Vacuum$(), reheats it into $(fluid)Reheating Plasma$(), grows $(item)No-Boundary Seeds$() - and, once you understand conformal cyclic cosmology, a new $(item)Universe Seed$() out of the end of an old universe."
    },
