      "text": "$(thing)Where these go$():$(li)$(item)Inflaton Condensate$(): No-Boundary Seed, Pocket Universe, Reheating Plasma, Universe Seed$(li)$(item)No-Boundary Seed$(): Universe Seed$(li)$(item)Universe Seed$(): Abiogenesis Crucible, Arbor Simulacrum, Bubble Universe, Cosmological Constant, Dimensional Residue and more"
